      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats what people always say, isnt it? it sounds nice but it doesnt feel true. some people just have too much damage. i feel like i've spent my whole life trying to \"heal\" and i'm just tired. like, what if there actually isn't a version of me that isn't just a collection of scars and mistakes? what if the damage is just who i am now?",
