      "content": "i appreciate the sentiment but honestly it just feels like a loop. i'm just so exhausted by the effort of existing. it's like carrying a weight that never gets lighter, and everyone tells me to just keep walking, but they don't see that i'm actually running out of road. sometimes i look at the idea of just... letting go... and it doesn't even feel scary anymore. it just looks like peace. like finally being allowed to stop fighting.",
